{{see also|Texas's 24th congressional district}}
The 24th district encompasses the suburbs north of [[Fort Worth]] and [[Dallas]], including [[Grapevine, Texas|Grapevine]], [[Bedford, Texas|Bedford]], and [[Park Cities, Texas|Park Cities]]. The incumbent was Republican [[Beth Van Duyne]], who was re-elected with 59.75% of the vote in 2022.<ref name="HPVT"/>

