{{see also|Texas's 25th congressional district}}
The 25th district runs from [[Arlington, Texas|Arlington]] out to rural exurbs of southern [[Fort Worth, Texas|Fort Worth]] such as [[Granbury, Texas|Granbury]]. The incumbent was Republican [[Roger Williams (Texas politician)|Roger Williams]], who was re-elected unopposed in 2022.<ref name="HPVT"/>

