{{see also|Texas's 38th congressional district}}
The 38th district is based in the north and northwest [[Harris County, Texas|Harris County]] [[Houston]] suburbs such as [[Jersey Village, Texas|Jersey Village]], [[Cypress, Texas|Cypress]], [[Tomball, Texas|Tomball]], [[Katy, Texas|Katy]], and [[Klein, Texas|Klein]]. The incumbent was Republican [[Wesley Hunt]], who was elected with 62.95% of the vote in 2022.<ref name="HPVT"/>

